  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "description": "DWD COSMO-REA6 regional reanalysis (hourly, 1995-2019) aggregated to NUTS regions. Not loaded on this server yet.",
  "time": {
    "from": "2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "to": "2018-03-15T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Data status",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 17,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "No data on this server",
      "datasource": null,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The DWD crawler has not been run here, so `dwd.cosmo` does not exist yet** and every panel below stays empty (or reports a missing relation) until it is.\n\nThe crawler (`oeds/crawler/dwd.py`, needs the `pygrib` library) downloads the monthly COSMO-REA6 GRIB files from opendata.dwd.de, averages the 6 km grid cells into NUTS regions and writes one row per hour and region to table `cosmo`: `time` (timestamptz, UTC), `nuts`, `country`, `temp_air` (K), `ghi` (net short-wave radiation at the surface, W/m2), `dni`, `dhi`, `wind_zonal`/`wind_meridional` (m/s), `rain_con`/`rain_gsp` (convective and grid-scale precipitation, mm), `cloud_cover` (fraction/percent). COSMO-REA6 covers 1995-01 to 2019-08, so the default range is a historic winter period. The panels are written against this table layout.\n\nNote for whoever runs it: the ASOB_S field is the *net* short-wave balance rather than global horizontal irradiation, and the crawler stores ASWDIFD_S (diffuse) as `dni` and ASWDIR_S (direct) as `dhi`, which looks swapped."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 9
      },
      "id": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Data status",
      "description": "First and latest timestamp per table, age of the latest value and approximate row count. Status compares the age with the update cadence of the source: OK within the expected age, LATE up to 3x, STALE beyond; 'static' tables are not updated any more.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT 'dwd.cosmo' AS \"Table\", min(time) AS \"First\", max(time) AS \"Latest\", round((extract(epoch FROM now() - max(time))/3600)::numeric, 1) AS \"Age (h)\", approximate_row_count('dwd.cosmo'::regclass) AS \"Rows (approx.)\", NULL::numeric AS \"Expected max age (h)\", 'static' AS \"Status\" FROM dwd.cosmo"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Status"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "OK": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "OK",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "LATE": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "text": "LATE",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "STALE": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "STALE",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "static": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "text": "static",
                        "index": 3
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Age (h)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "h"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Rows (approx.)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "First"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsIso"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Latest"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsIso"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 9
      },
      "id": 19
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Region $nuts",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 20,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Air temperature in $nuts",
      "description": "Hourly 2 m air temperature of the selected region (NUTS ids in column `nuts`; countries are the 2-letter ids).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT $__timeGroupAlias(\"time\", $__interval), avg(temp_air - 273.15) AS \"temperature\" FROM dwd.cosmo\nWHERE $__timeFilter(\"time\") AND nuts = '${nuts}' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "celsius"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 21
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Wind in $nuts",
      "description": "10 m wind speed derived from the zonal and meridional components.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT $__timeGroupAlias(\"time\", $__interval), avg(sqrt(wind_zonal ^ 2 + wind_meridional ^ 2)) AS \"wind speed\" FROM dwd.cosmo\nWHERE $__timeFilter(\"time\") AND nuts = '${nuts}' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "velocityms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
